      <CodeBlock code={"{\n  \"name\": \"ebs-cloud-credentials\",\n  \"namespace\": \"openshift-cluster-csi-drivers\"\n}\n{\n  \"name\": \"cloud-credential-operator-iam-ro-creds\",\n  \"namespace\": \"openshift-cloud-credential-operator\"\n}"} lang="json" />
      </li>
      <li>
      Delete each of the referenced component secrets:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc delete secret <secret_name> \\//<1>\n  -n <secret_namespace> (2)"} lang="terminal" />
      <p>where:</p>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>&lt;secret_name&gt;</code></dt>
